source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Show a to-do on your own date ("mon 9am", "in 3d", "fri"). The due date stays as it is

Usage: mxr todo snooze [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID> [WHEN]...

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>
  [WHEN]...  When it should show up

Options:
      --clear              Go back to the date mxr worked out
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
